    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Dawn_of_Defiance\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Dawn of Defiance\">Star Wars Saga Edition Dawn of Defiance</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Traitor%27s_Gambit\" title=\"The Traitor's Gambit\">The Traitor's Gambit</a>)</i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p><i>These fungi are extremely dangerous and, like the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exploding_Fungus\" title=\"Exploding Fungus\">Exploding Fungus</a>, activate only when someone gets too close.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Razor_Mushroom_Statistics_.28CL_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Razor_Mushroom_Statistics_(CL_2)\">Razor Mushroom Statistics (CL 2)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Contact, Natural </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A being or object comes into contact with a Razor Mushroom. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +3 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> On Trigger; Once per Razor Mushroom </p>",
